=2 Final Cutscenes
* **Wait until Japanese midnight** to finish the following epilogue cutscenes for {p:Chains of Promathia}.
* You can complete these in any order.
* While these cutscenes are not displayed in your Mission log, they all have mission names. These names are referenced in the {p:Goblin Footprints|Goblin Footprint} and {p:Cutscene Replay} Bards.
** **Louverance** - __A Name for the Ages__:
*** Head to {z:Southern San d'Oria} (Home Point #4) and talk to {n:Hinaree} at (B-6) for a cutscene.
*** Zone into {z:Uleguerand Range} for a cutscene. (Any Home Point you may have in the zone, or Voidwatch Warp via Atmacite Refiner -> Tavnazia -> Uleguerand Range, works.)
*** Return to {z:Southern San d'Oria} and approach Count Caffaule's Manor (B-6) for a cutscene.
** **Chebukkis** - __A Meteoric Reunion__:
*** Head to {z:Port Windurst} (Home Point #1) and talk to {n:Chipmy-Popmy} at the Fishing Guild (C-8) for a cutscene (NOT just dialgue). You may need to talk to this NPC more than once until he mentions {p:Bibiki Bay - Purgonorgo Isle} lest you take another boat ride stinking of missed cutscene shame.
*** Head to {p:Bibiki Bay - Purgonorgo Isle} via the ferry from {p:Bibiki Bay} and talk to {p:??? Warmachine} (H-11) for a cutscene.
**** The fastest way is to take the {p:Voidwatch Warp} from any present-day {p:Atmacite Refiner} if you've obtained the {k:Hyacinth stratum abyssite II} (Tavnazia > Bibiki Bay). There's an atmacite refiner at Home Point #1 in either {z:Tavnazian Safehold} or the nearby {z:Windurst Waters}.
**** If you have a summer seasonal +1 item with **Enchantment: Teleport (Purgonorgo Isle)**, that would take you to the same location. Those items are:
***** {@i:Custom Gilet +1|11273} {i:Custom Gilet +1|Custom Gilet +1|11273} / {@i:Custom Top +1|11274} {i:Custom Top +1|Custom Top +1|11274} / {@i:Magna Gilet +1|11275} {i:Magna Gilet +1|Magna Gilet +1|11275} / {@i:Magna Top +1|11276} {i:Magna Top +1|Magna Top +1|11276} / {@i:Wonder Maillot +1|11277} {i:Wonder Maillot +1|Wonder Maillot +1|11277} / {@i:Wonder Top +1|11278} {i:Wonder Top +1|Wonder Top +1|11278} / {@i:Elder Gilet +1|11280} {i:Elder Gilet +1|Elder Gilet +1|11280} /{@i:Savage Top +1|11279} {i:Savage Top +1|Savage Top +1|11279}
*** When the cutscene ends, you will receive a colored drop that appears to be random.
**** The odds of each are unknown, but it should be one of the following: {i:Red (STR+5)|Red Drop|4258}, {i:Clear (INT+5)|Clear Drop|4259}, {i:Green (AGI+5)|Green Drop|4260}, {i:Yellow (VIT+5)|Yellow Drop|4261} / {i:Purple (DEX+5)|Purple Drop|4262}, {i:Blue (MND+5)|Blue Drop|4263}, {i:White (CHR+5)|White Drop|4264}, or {i:Black (Instant Warp)|Black Drop|4265}. Stat buffs last 15 minutes, and all drops will give the 1 hour detrimental {p:Medicated} effect.
** **Shikarees** - __In the Name of Justice__:
*** Zone into {z:Mhaura} for a cutscene.
** **Jabbos** - __Newfound Family__:
*** Zone into {z:Oldton Movalpolos} (Survival Guide works) for a cutscene.
** **Tenzen** - __Return to the East__:
*** Head to {z:Metalworks} and talk to {p:Cid} (H-8) for a cutscene.
* Once you've completed the previous cutscenes, head to {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} and approach the **Palace** for a cutscene.
* Head to {z:Upper Jeuno} and click on the {n:Door: Marble Bridge} for a cutscene.
* Click on the **Marble Bridge** door again to choose one of the 3 rings: {@i:File:Rajas Ring icon.png|15543} {i:Rajas Ring|Rajas Ring|15543}, {@i:File:Sattva Ring icon.png|15544} {i:Sattva Ring|Sattva Ring|15544}, {@i:File:Tamas Ring icon.png|15545} {i:Tamas Ring|Tamas Ring|15545}.
** You can continue with the cutscenes without making your decision yet.
* Head to {z:Tavnazian Safehold} (Home Point #3) and check the **Walnut Door** (K-7).
* Head to {z:Lufaise Meadows} and approach the **Blueblade Fell** (J-6) for the final cutscene.
** {z:Lufaise Meadows} UNM 119 or 125 Warp is the fastest route.
** The cutscene trigger is right after the first barrel on the ground in the Fell.
* After all cutscenes are over, you have option to start both of the quests {q:Requiem of Sin|Requiem of Sin|Requiem of Sin} and {q:Storms of Fate|Storms of Fate|Storms of Fate}.

=2 Optional
* Trust: Ulmia: After defeating {m:Promathia}, examine the **Dilapidated Gate** in {z:Misareaux Coast} (I-11) to obtain {p:Ulmia|BGWiki:Trusts} as a Trust.
** You can take the exit from {z:Tavnazian Safehold} (G-6) to reach it quicker.
** This can be done prior to the final cutscenes above.
** Further progress into the CoP epilogue quests ({q:Storms of Fate|Storms of Fate|Storms of Fate}, {q:Shadows of the Departed|Shadows of the Departed|Shadows of the Departed}, {q:Apocalypse Nigh|Apocalypse Nigh|Apocalypse Nigh}) can prevent this cutscene.

* Trust: Prishe: After finishing all the final cutscenes above, examine the **Walnut Door** in {z:Tavnazian Safehold} (K-7, Top floor) to obtain {p:Prishe|BGWiki:Trusts} as a Trust.
** Further progress into the CoP epilogue quests ({q:Storms of Fate|Storms of Fate|Storms of Fate}, {q:Shadows of the Departed|Shadows of the Departed|Shadows of the Departed}, {q:Apocalypse Nigh|Apocalypse Nigh|Apocalypse Nigh} can prevent this cutscene.

* Atma Rewards: You can now purchase the {@k} {k:Atma of the Banisher} from an {n:Atma Fabricant} in {p:Abyssea}.

* **Diabolos** cutscene: '{q:Waking Dreams|Waking Dreams|Waking Dreams} pt. 9.
** If {q:Waking Dreams|Waking Dreams|Waking Dreams} was already completed, you can see this cutscene from the {p:Goblin Footprint} in {z:The Shrouded Maw} (near Pso'Xja Home Point #1), by trading an item or gil to the footprint.
* {q:Tango with a Tracker|Tango with a Tracker|Tango with a Tracker} (level 75+) is available.
** {q:Requiem of Sin|Requiem of Sin|Requiem of Sin} (level 90+) will be available after completing 'Tango with a Tracker' and waiting until the next {p:Conquest Tally}.
* {q:Return to the Depths|Return to the Depths|Return to the Depths} (level 75+ to solo).
* {p:Waking the Beast} (level 99+ to solo).
* Other activities
** {p:Dynamis - Original Areas|Category:Dynamis} - Finish the storyline (level 90+).
** {p:Dynamis - Dreamworld Areas|Category:Dynamis} - Finish the storyline (level 75+).
** {p:Limbus|Category:Limbus} (level 99+)

